1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,182
On that day in twenty fifteen, the ground shook at a particular frequency.

2
00:00:05,182 --> 00:00:11,145
The buildings whose natural frequency matched the shaking were driven at resonance.

3
00:00:11,145 --> 00:00:12,903
Their swings grew and grew.

4
00:00:12,903 --> 00:00:15,859
That one word is the answer: resonance.

5
00:00:15,859 --> 00:00:21,861
It is why engineers now tune buildings, and add damping, to keep them away from it.

